  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components, adjust pH to 6.0 -- 6.5 and autoclave. After cooling, add the following solutions (filter--sterilized) to the medium:"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Distribute the medium into culture vessels (leave >80% volume gas phase) under a N2--CO2 (4:1) gas mixture and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Pressurize the culture vessels to 200 kPa with methane gas.Finally add O2 gas to make up 2% O2 concentration in the gas phase. Readjust pH to 6.0 -- 6.3, if necessary."
    }
  ]
}